00:29:04.870 --> 00:29:09.390
The subject, "Should our divorce laws be changed?"

00:29:09.390 --> 00:29:11.270
Here again, speaking for our program,

00:29:11.270 --> 00:29:19.880
Mr. Pat Paulson, Vice President.

00:29:19.880 --> 00:29:22.320
- Most every married couple you meet nowadays

00:29:27.130 --> 00:29:28.890
is talking about divorce.

00:29:30.000 --> 00:29:33.580
In fact, I was talking to my wife about divorce just this morning.

00:29:34.860 --> 00:29:41.590
And her lawyers, well, I believe our divorce laws are good just as they are.

00:29:43.030 --> 00:29:45.190
Many of them go back to the early 1800s.

00:29:45.680 --> 00:29:49.410
And what was good enough for the savage Indians is good enough for us.

00:29:50.150 --> 00:29:54.770
I believe I can say that without fear of contradiction.

00:29:56.490 --> 00:29:58.170
Let's examine our divorce laws.

00:29:59.060 --> 00:30:00.000
Take the community.

00:30:00.060 --> 00:30:05.530
property settlement. Any law that allows a man to keep half of what he owns can't be

00:30:05.530 --> 00:30:14.400
all bad. Most divorce decisions favor the woman. The court always feels that the woman

00:30:14.400 --> 00:30:21.020
is too good for the man. This, however, does not explain why the man has to spend the rest

00:30:21.020 --> 00:30:30.000
of his life paying alimony to his ex-wife because nobody wants her. If I'm

00:30:30.000 --> 00:30:35.980
I may quote an expert on the subject, a Supreme Court Justice, who said, "This is certainly

00:30:35.980 --> 00:30:41.510
grabs the place of the ceremony, the devil gourds the mountain climbing."

00:30:41.510 --> 00:30:49.150
Of course, divorce where children are involved is different, but it's the children's fault

00:30:49.150 --> 00:30:53.950
for getting married in the first place.

00:30:53.950 --> 00:30:55.930
Time has come for plain talk in court.

00:30:55.930 --> 00:31:00.000
Why does a man have to lie about his legal grounds for divorce with all

00:31:00.000 --> 00:31:00.920
those fancy terms

00:31:00.920 --> 00:31:02.320
like incompatibility

00:31:02.320 --> 00:31:04.600
why can't a man

00:31:04.600 --> 00:31:05.280
go into court

00:31:05.280 --> 00:31:06.060
and calmly say

00:31:06.060 --> 00:31:06.600
under oath

00:31:06.600 --> 00:31:08.430
I hate her guts

00:31:08.430 --> 00:31:14.840
or a woman say

00:31:14.840 --> 00:31:15.960
I hate his guts

00:31:15.960 --> 00:31:17.700
or in the case

00:31:17.700 --> 00:31:18.360
of a bigamist

00:31:18.360 --> 00:31:19.610
I hate their guts

