00:55:53.200 --> 00:55:56.730
And please put on the thing, Mother's Day card on the envelope.

00:55:56.730 --> 00:55:57.740
That's right.

00:55:57.740 --> 00:56:00.000
So we can identify them and so they'll get to the right

00:56:00.030 --> 00:56:05.130
people. These cards are just to cost as much as a regular Mother's Day card around a quarter

00:56:05.130 --> 00:56:10.810
or something like that. So please, something very important. Mother's Day is really a lovely

00:56:10.810 --> 00:56:15.310
holiday and it's a wonderful way to get away from commercialism and to do something like

00:56:15.310 --> 00:56:21.020
this, which we feel very strongly about. So what else can we say except good night. Good night.

00:56:21.020 --> 00:56:21.520
Good night.

